  {
    "udt_struct_v0": {
      "doc": "Per-destination-domain configuration. `evm_style` selects the `mint_recipient` shape\\ncheck: EVM addresses are 20 bytes left-padded into 32, Solana pubkeys fill all 32.\\n\\n`forward` turns on Circle's Forwarding Service for this destination, and `max_forward_fee` is\\nthe most a signed request's `max_fee` may be on that path, in 7-decimal stroops. It is per\\nchain because forward fees differ by two orders of magnitude (Arc about $0.02, Solana about\\n$0.15, Ethereum about $1.13), so one global cap would either strand the expensive chains or\\nleave the cheap ones unprotected. Raising it, or turning `forward` on, goes through the 48h\\ntimelock; lowering it or turning `forward` off is instant (`tighten_domain`).",
      "lib": "",
      "name": "DomainCfg",
      "fields": [
        {
          "doc": "Circle's forwarder can create the recipient's Solana USDC token account as part of the\\nforward (an extended hook carrying the owner's address). When set, a request that says its\\nrecipient needs an account is forwarded too, with that hook, instead of falling back to the\\nrelay. Only meaningful for a non-EVM destination that also has `forward` on. Proven on\\nmainnet for Stellar -> Solana (docs/forwarding-wrapper.md).",
          "name": "account_creation",
          "type_": "bool"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "domain",
          "type_": "u32"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "evm_style",
          "type_": "bool"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "forward",
          "type_": "bool"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "max_forward_fee",
          "type_": "i128"
        },
        {
          "doc": "The most a signed `max_fee` may be when the forwarder also creates the account. Separate from\\n`max_forward_fee` because the fee is roughly double (about $0.34 vs $0.17 on Solana) and a\\nsingle cap would either block account creation or leave ordinary transfers unprotected.\\nZero unless `account_creation` is on.",
          "name": "max_forward_fee_new_account",
          "type_": "i128"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
