  {
    "event_v0": {
      "doc": "Topic: `bridge_initiated`.\\n\\nThe join to Circle's own burn event is the transaction hash \\xe2\\x80\\x94 which is how\\n`packages/cctp-client/src/iris.ts` queries attestations anyway\\n(`getMessages(domain, transactionHash)`), and `bridge` and `deposit_for_burn` are the\\nsame transaction by construction. `transfer_id` adds a collision-free primary key for\\n`cctp_transfers`, unique even for two identical bridges in one ledger. `fee_bps`/\\n`min_fee` are emitted so historical revenue can be re-derived without reconstructing\\ncontract state at that ledger.",
      "lib": "",
      "name": "BridgeInitiated",
      "prefix_topics": [
        "bridge_initiated"
      ],
      "params": [
